1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,361
This cat is falling upside down, with nothing to push on.

2
00:00:03,861 --> 00:00:08,987
In 1894, scientists thought it cheated, pushing off the hand.

3
00:00:09,487 --> 00:00:10,028
It did not.

4
00:00:10,028 --> 00:00:12,734
It bends in the middle, and turns each half on its own.

5
00:00:13,234 --> 00:00:17,847
Front legs tucked in, the front half spins round, while the stretched-out back barely moves.

6
00:00:18,347 --> 00:00:20,897
Then it swaps, and the back half catches up.

7
00:00:20,897 --> 00:00:21,476
Feet down.

8
00:00:21,976 --> 00:00:24,600
But from very low, it runs out of time to turn.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,929
Cat person or dog person?
